6176d321-7dec-4e03-8714-444492f92bc8	039da5c7-2658-486a-a120-ad368d9eae7e	{"en": "Council Meeting", "mi": "Council Meeting", "ar-MA": "اجتماع المجلس", "ar-SA": "اجتماع المجلس", "ca-ES": "Reunió del Consell", "cy-GB": "Cyfarfod y Cyngor", "da-DK": "Rådsmøde", "de-DE": "Ratssitzung", "el-GR": "Συνεδρίαση του Συμβουλίου", "en-CA": "Council Meeting", "en-GB": "Council Meeting", "en-IE": "Council Meeting", "es-CL": "Reunión del Consejo", "es-ES": "Reunión del Consejo", "fi-FI": "Neuvoston kokous", "fr-BE": "Conseil Communal", "fr-FR": "Conseil Communal", "hr-HR": "Sastanak vijeća", "hu-HU": "Tanácsülés", "it-IT": "Riunione del Consiglio", "kl-GL": "Siunnersuisooqatigiit ataatsimiinnerat", "lb-LU": "Conseilssëtzung", "lt-LT": "Tarybos posėdis", "lv-LV": "Padomes sēde", "nb-NO": "Rådsmøte", "nl-BE": "Gemeenteraad", "nl-NL": "Gemeenteraad", "pa-IN": "Council Meeting", "pl-PL": "Posiedzenie Rady", "pt-BR": "Reunião do Conselho", "ro-RO": "Ședința consiliului local", "sr-SP": "Састанак Савета", "sv-SE": "Rådsmöte", "tr-TR": "Kurul Toplantısı", "ur-PK": "Council Meeting", "sr-Latn": "Sastanak odbora"}	{"en": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "mi": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "ar-MA": "<p> في اجتماع المجلس هذا، سيتم تقديم مبادرات المواطنين التي حصلت على 100 صوت في أقل من 3 أشهر. </p><p>سيتبادل أعضاء المجلس وجهات النظر حول كل فكرة.</p>\\n", "ar-SA": "<p> في اجتماع المجلس هذا، سيتم تقديم مبادرات المواطنين التي حصلت على 100 صوت في أقل من 3 أشهر. </p><p>سيتبادل أعضاء المجلس وجهات النظر حول كل فكرة.</p>\\n", "ca-ES": "<p>Durant aquest consell es presentaran aquelles iniciatives ciutadanes que hagin aconseguit 100 vots en menys de 3 mesos.</p><p>A continuació, el consistori compartirà la seva visió sobre cada idea.</p>\\n", "cy-GB": "<p>Yn ystod cyfarfod y cyngor hwn, bydd y mentrau dinasyddion hynny a enillodd 100 o bleidleisiau mewn llai na 3 mis, yn cael eu cyflwyno.</p><p>Bydd y cyngor wedyn yn rhannu eu barn ar bob syniad.</p>\\n", "da-DK": "<p>Under dette rådsmøde vil de forslag, der har samlet 100 stemmer på mindre end 3 måneder, blive præsenteret.</p><p> Rådet vil så belyse deres perspektiv på hver idé.</p>\\n", "de-DE": "<p>Während dieser Ratssitzung werden jene Vorschläge vorgestellt, die in weniger als 3 Monaten 100 Stimmen gewonnen haben.</p><p> Der Rat wird dann seine Sichtweise auf jede der Ideen darlegen.</p>\\n", "el-GR": "<p>Κατά τη διάρκεια αυτής της συνεδρίασης του Συμβουλίου, θα παρουσιαστούν οι πρωτοβουλίες των πολιτών που συγκέντρωσαν 100 ψήφους σε λιγότερο από 3 μήνες.</p><p>Στη συνέχεια, το συμβούλιο θα μοιραστεί την άποψή του για κάθε ιδέα.</p>\\n", "en-CA": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "en-GB": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "en-IE": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "es-CL": "<p>Durante esta reunión del concejo, se presentarán aquellas propuestas ciudadanas que obtuvieron sobre 100 votos en menos de 3 meses.</p><p>El concejo entonces entregará su visión sobre cada idea.</p>\\n", "es-ES": "<p>Durante esta reunión del concejo, se presentarán aquellas propuestas ciudadanas que obtuvieron sobre 100 votos en menos de 3 meses.</p><p>El concejo entonces entregará su visión sobre cada idea.</p>\\n", "fi-FI": "<p>Tässä valtuuston kokouksessa esitellään alle 3 kuukaudessa 100 ääntä saaneet kansalaisaloitteet.</p><p>Neuvosto jakaa sitten näkemyksensä kustakin ideasta.</p>\\n", "fr-BE": "<p>Durant le conseil communal, les citoyens qui auront obtenu 100 votes en mois de 3 mois seront représenté.</p><p>Le conseil évaluera ensuite, chaque idée individuellement.</p>\\n", "fr-FR": "<p>Durant le conseil communal, les citoyens qui auront obtenu 100 votes en mois de 3 mois seront représenté.</p><p>Le conseil évaluera ensuite, chaque idée individuellement.</p>\\n", "hr-HR": "<p>Tijekom ovog sastanka vijeća bit će predstavljene one inicijative građana koje su dobile 100 glasova u manje od 3 mjeseca.</p><p>Vijeće će zatim podijeliti svoje mišljenje o svakoj ideji.</p>\\n", "hu-HU": "<p>Ezen a tanácsülésen bemutatásra kerülnek azok az állampolgári kezdeményezések, amelyek kevesebb mint 3 hónap alatt 100 szavazatot szereztek.</p><p>A tanács ezután megosztja véleményét az egyes ötletekről.</p>\\n", "it-IT": "<p>Durante questa riunione del consiglio, saranno presentate le iniziative dei cittadini che hanno ottenuto 100 voti in meno di 3 mesi.</p><p>Il consiglio condividerà poi la sua opinione su ogni idea.</p>\\n", "kl-GL": "Siunnersuisooqatigiit ataatsimiinneranni uani innuttaasut siunnersuutaat qaammatit pingasut qaangiutinngitsut 100-nik taasisoqareersimasut saqqummiunneqassapput. Tamanna pereerpat siunnersuisooqatigiit isumassarsiat ataasiakkaarlugit erseqqissaateqarfigissavaat.  \\n", "lb-LU": "<p>Bei dëser Conseilssëtzung wäerten déi Biergerinitiativen dobäi sinn, déi 100 Stëmmen a manner wéi 3 Méint kruten. </p><p>De Conseil wäert da seng Usiichten zu all Iddi matdeelen.</p>\\n", "lt-LT": "<p>Šiame tarybos posėdyje bus pristatytos piliečių iniciatyvos, kurios per mažiau nei 3 mėnesius surinko 100 balsų.</p><p>Tada taryba pasidalys savo nuomone apie kiekvieną idėją.</p>\\n", "lv-LV": "<p>Šajā padomes sēdē tiks prezentētas tās iedzīvotāju iniciatīvas, kas mazāk nekā 3 mēnešu laikā ieguvušas 100 balsis.</p><p>Pēc tam padomes pārstāvji paudīs savu viedokli par katru ideju.</p>\\n", "nb-NO": "<p>Under dette rådsmøtet vil de innbyggerinitiativene som har fått 100 stemmer på mindre enn tre måneder, bli presentert.</p><p>Rådet vil deretter dele sitt syn på hver enkelt idé.</p>\\n", "nl-BE": "<p>Tijdens deze zitting van de gemeenteraad worden die burgervoorstellen voorgesteld die 100 stemmen verzamelden in minder dan 3 maanden.</p><p>De raad geeft daarna feedback op elk idee.</p>\\n", "nl-NL": "<p>Tijdens deze zitting van de gemeenteraad worden die burgervoorstellen voorgesteld die 100 stemmen verzamelden in minder dan 3 maanden.</p><p>De raad geeft daarna feedback op elk voorstel.</p>\\n", "pa-IN": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "pl-PL": "<p>Podczas tego posiedzenia Rady zostaną przedstawione inicjatywy obywatelskie, które uzyskały 100 głosów w okresie krótszym niż 3 miesiące.</p><p>Rada wyrazi następnie swoje opinie o każdym z pomysłów.</p>\\n", "pt-BR": "<p>Durante esta reunião do conselho, serão apresentadas as iniciativas cidadãs que obtiveram 100 votos em menos de 3 meses.</p>&gt;<p>O conselho partilhará então a sua opinião sobre cada ideia.</p>\\n", "ro-RO": "<p> În cursul acestei reuniunii a consiliului local, acele inițiative cetățenești care au adunat 100 de voturi în mai puțin de 3 luni, vor fi prezentate.</p><p> Apoi consiliul local își va împărtăși propria viziune cu privire la fiecare idee.</p>\\n", "sr-SP": "<p>На овој седници Већа биће представљене оне грађанске иницијативе које су за мање од 3 месеца добиле 100 гласова.</p><p>Веће ће затим поделити своје мишљење о свакој идеји.</p>\\n", "sv-SE": "<p>Under det här rådsmötet presenteras medborgarinitiativen som fick 100 röster på mindre än 3 månader.</p><p>Rådet delar sedan med sig av sin syn på respektive idé.</p>\\n", "tr-TR": "<p>Bu kurul toplantısında, 3 aydan kısa bir süre içinde 100 oy alan vatandaş girişimleri sunulacaktır.</p><p>Kurul daha sonra her bir fikir hakkındaki görüşlerini paylaşacaktır.</p>\\n", "ur-PK": "<p>During this council meeting, those citizen initiatives that gained 100 votes in less than 3 months, will be presented.</p><p>The council will then share their view on each idea.</p>\\n", "sr-Latn": "<p> Tokom ovog sastanka biće predstavljene građanske inicijative koje su dobile 100 glasova za manje od 3 meseca. </p> <p> Veće će zatim podeliti svoje mišljenje o svakoj ideji. </p>\\n"}	{}	2019-09-24 17:00:00.1	2019-09-24 19:00:00.1	2026-01-02 15:36:04.184134	2026-01-02 15:36:04.184134	\N	\N	0	{}	\N	{}	\N	\N
